  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "じぶんの　ＨＰを　すこし　けずって\nぶんしんを　だす。\nぶんしんは　じぶんの　みがわりに　なる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "자신의 HP를 조금 깎아서\n분신을 만든다.\n분신은 자신의 대타가 된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "消耗一些自己的ＨＰ，\n製造分身。\n分身將成為自己的替身。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur crée un clone en sacrifiant quelques PV.\nCe clone sert de leurre.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender setzt eine kleine Menge an KP ein, um einen\nDoppelgänger zu erzeugen, der für ihn Schläge\neinsteckt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Utiliza parte de los PS propios para crear un sustituto\nque actúa como señuelo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa crea una copia di se stesso usando\nalcuni PS. La copia serve come esca per il nemico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user creates a substitute for itself using some of\nits HP. The substitute serves as the user’s decoy.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "自分の　ＨＰを　少し　削って\n分身を　だす。\n分身は　自分の　身代わりに　なる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "削减少许自己的ＨＰ，\n制造分身。\n分身将成为自己的替身。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Utiliza parte de los PS propios para crear un sustituto\nque actúa como señuelo.",
      "version_group": {
